WEBVTT

00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:04.864
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Remember, when you watch TV...

00:00:04.864 --> 00:00:06.234
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Turn on the lights...

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:07.204
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
and sit back from the TV!

00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:07.604
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.

00:00:07.604 --> 00:00:09.934
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Great job, girls!

00:00:10.574 --> 00:00:17.674
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:24.554
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:32.794
Meeting you like I did

00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:37.994
Wasn't just so we could live

00:00:39.274 --> 00:00:44.794
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:00:45.204 --> 00:00:49.804
And surely change the future

00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:53.314
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:00:53.314 --> 00:00:56.444
Is released (changing yourself)

00:00:56.584 --> 00:01:02.324
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:03.764 --> 00:01:06.334
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:09.164
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:09.404 --> 00:01:15.564
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:18.504
The power given to me

00:01:18.504 --> 00:01:21.144
Spurs me into the sky

00:01:21.144 --> 00:01:26.874
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:27.214 --> 00:01:32.744
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:01:40.964 --> 00:01:41.334
B-But!

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.204
29th sense: "The Art of Coaxing!
The Sea Closest to Heaven"
B-But!

00:01:43.204 --> 00:01:44.364
29th sense: "The Art of Coaxing!
The Sea Closest to Heaven"

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:48.734
Don't cry! I'm the one who's been hurt here!

00:02:05.894 --> 00:02:09.084
Uh-oh! It's the Stone Drop Effect!
They've lost control of their ESP!

00:02:09.564 --> 00:02:11.924
WE'RE SORRY!

00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:15.364
We didn't think it was such a bad thing!

00:02:15.564 --> 00:02:19.374
Everyone hates me! The sun hates me!

00:02:19.374 --> 00:02:21.634
Puppies hate me!

00:02:23.874 --> 00:02:26.364
G-Girls! Calm down!

00:02:26.844 --> 00:02:29.834
Here! Fly to my bosom!

00:02:31.944 --> 00:02:33.214
Here!

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:35.844
Here!

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:42.954
NO!

00:02:43.864 --> 00:02:45.524
Everyone, calm down!

00:02:45.524 --> 00:02:46.994
Minamoto!

00:02:46.994 --> 00:02:49.394
You do something about it! I don't care anymore!

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:54.334
Director Tsubomi!

00:02:54.334 --> 00:02:55.304
What? That's her?

00:02:55.604 --> 00:02:58.664
Okay, okay. That's enough.

00:03:01.174 --> 00:03:04.204
She stopped that rampage...

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:08.914
Shame on you, Minamoto!
Making these girls cry!

00:03:09.384 --> 00:03:12.484
And whose fault was all this in the first place?!

00:03:12.484 --> 00:03:15.284
No matter what you say, I'm not doing this! I'm...

00:03:15.554 --> 00:03:16.464
Listen to me!

00:03:16.464 --> 00:03:18.094
Ooh, what a handsome man!

00:03:18.094 --> 00:03:19.724
And you are lovely.

00:03:19.894 --> 00:03:22.294
Ooh! Fujiko's so glad to hear that!

00:03:22.294 --> 00:03:24.094
Time to eat!

00:03:25.974 --> 00:03:30.274
Y-Y-You've lived quite a long time,
haven't you, Director Tsubomi?!

00:03:30.274 --> 00:03:34.474
Naughty boy, reading a lady's age
from her lips like that!

00:03:34.474 --> 00:03:36.414
Well, if you'll excuse me...

00:03:37.744 --> 00:03:38.644
Like this?

00:03:38.644 --> 00:03:40.284
No, like this.

00:03:40.284 --> 00:03:41.974
You mean like this?

00:03:45.784 --> 00:03:47.124
Dr. Sakaki?

00:03:47.194 --> 00:03:49.054
What's wrong?

00:03:49.594 --> 00:03:52.184
Please! Let me forget!

00:03:56.604 --> 00:03:58.224
So, what were we talking about, again?

00:03:58.534 --> 00:04:03.004
Look, let's just you and me
discuss what happened.

00:04:03.004 --> 00:04:06.844
If you won't accept it,
you can resign or whatever you like.

00:04:06.844 --> 00:04:09.314
Hold it! HOLD IT!

00:04:09.314 --> 00:04:11.984
I demand that a lawyer accompany us!

00:04:11.984 --> 00:04:13.984
"Please, I don't want to shoot you."

00:04:13.984 --> 00:04:16.074
"What will come of this war?"

00:04:17.884 --> 00:04:20.854
Don't you want to know how much I know?

00:04:25.224 --> 00:04:28.834
It's okay. Just leave Minamoto to me.

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:31.264
I'll make him cancel his resignation.

00:04:31.264 --> 00:04:32.064
Really?

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:36.944
I promise.

00:04:37.304 --> 00:04:41.274
Fujiko would never do that
on a whim or as a joke.

00:04:41.274 --> 00:04:43.674
I absolutely promise to change his mind.

00:04:49.554 --> 00:04:51.424
Okay, we've arrived.

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:53.424
Where are we?

00:04:53.424 --> 00:04:56.294
The site of a former Imperial Army facility.

00:04:56.294 --> 00:04:59.024
This sea was a place Igo loved.

00:04:59.024 --> 00:04:59.794
Igo?

00:05:02.634 --> 00:05:04.864
It was so much fun back then.

00:05:05.004 --> 00:05:10.444
We all believed we were building
a happy future with our powers.

00:05:10.744 --> 00:05:12.804
I hope Igo's all right.

00:05:13.474 --> 00:05:17.884
Because it would prove that sad
future isn't an absolute certainty.

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:20.814
You know everything, don't you?

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:22.654
Did you know, Minamoto?

00:05:22.654 --> 00:05:24.584
Kaoru, don't!

00:05:28.794 --> 00:05:30.764
We all produced the telepathic

00:05:30.764 --> 00:05:33.534
and clairvoyant protection he used together.

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:35.534
The decryption key was never changed.

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:38.404
I knew about it as soon as I scanned you.

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:42.604
Director... What did that trick you
played have to do with this?

00:05:42.604 --> 00:05:47.004
You just can't get in the mood, can you?
Quit being such a stick in the mud!

00:05:47.544 --> 00:05:52.074
Is that because you're going to get
stuck shooting Kaoru in 10 years?

00:05:53.484 --> 00:05:55.854
It's not like I wanted to do that!

00:05:55.854 --> 00:05:58.024
I mean, that won't happen!

00:05:58.024 --> 00:05:59.984
I'll work hard every day to
keep it from happening!

00:06:00.224 --> 00:06:02.694
You think you won't be doing that in 10 years?

00:06:03.494 --> 00:06:05.994
Being forthright and working hard?

00:06:05.994 --> 00:06:09.164
Until, at last, Hyobu takes those three girls.

00:06:09.164 --> 00:06:10.394
Don't you think?

00:06:12.304 --> 00:06:14.174
Then what do I do?

00:06:14.174 --> 00:06:16.234
Simple. You...

00:06:16.774 --> 00:06:19.044
should just marry them!

00:06:19.044 --> 00:06:21.514
Oh, sure. I get it...

00:06:23.214 --> 00:06:25.684
I wonder when Minamoto's coming back.

00:06:26.184 --> 00:06:28.414
I wonder where he is and what he's doing.

00:06:28.684 --> 00:06:32.414
I know Granny Tsubomi said it'd be all
right, but will he really come back?

00:06:33.154 --> 00:06:34.884
He was so mad...

00:06:35.494 --> 00:06:37.294
That was cruel! Cruel!

00:06:37.294 --> 00:06:39.054
I quit!

00:06:40.294 --> 00:06:43.334
Kaoru, isn't this flashback
totally not what happened?

00:06:43.334 --> 00:06:45.464
He cried? He ran off all pigeon-toed?

00:06:45.934 --> 00:06:49.164
Still... He was really worried about us, huh?

00:06:52.444 --> 00:06:53.174
Minamoto?

00:06:53.174 --> 00:06:54.004
He's back?

00:06:54.214 --> 00:06:55.704
Hello, girls!

00:06:56.914 --> 00:06:57.674
Chief...

00:06:58.984 --> 00:07:03.414
Oh, no! That is not a meal for growing girls!

00:07:05.854 --> 00:07:07.344
Well, I'll call for a delivery, then.

00:07:07.554 --> 00:07:09.244
Here!

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:13.264
While Minamoto is away,

00:07:13.264 --> 00:07:16.534
I will personally see to your health management!

00:07:16.534 --> 00:07:19.004
We're not that hungry right now...

00:07:19.204 --> 00:07:22.034
Unacceptable! You're growing girls!

00:07:22.034 --> 00:07:25.544
If this won't do, then order
anything that you want!

00:07:25.544 --> 00:07:26.774
Okay. Sushi.

00:07:26.844 --> 00:07:28.344
Sea urchin and salmon roe and fatty tuna.

00:07:28.344 --> 00:07:30.214
Red clams and Botan prawns.

00:07:31.184 --> 00:07:32.684
Take it all away!

00:07:32.684 --> 00:07:34.444
But, it's five star quality!

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:36.354
Huh? He's training?

00:07:36.354 --> 00:07:37.654
Mr. Minamoto is?

00:07:37.884 --> 00:07:40.624
Yes, according to the director.

00:07:40.624 --> 00:07:42.884
That seems to be what's going on. Here you go!

00:07:42.994 --> 00:07:44.594
She said she's going to improve him

00:07:44.594 --> 00:07:47.094
for a few days before he
comes back, and not to worry.

00:07:47.094 --> 00:07:48.964
Do you like abalone, Kashiwagi?

00:07:49.234 --> 00:07:52.304
What's he training for? How will he be improved?

00:07:52.304 --> 00:07:53.634
Here you go!

00:07:53.634 --> 00:07:55.274
Will it be improved lecturing?

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:56.204
Here you go!

00:07:56.404 --> 00:08:00.444
But isn't it weird how Granny
said she'd change his mind?

00:08:00.444 --> 00:08:01.914
Here you go!

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:03.114
What sort of training?

00:08:03.114 --> 00:08:04.374
Here you go!

00:08:05.914 --> 00:08:07.014
Where?

00:08:07.014 --> 00:08:09.674
Sorry for the wait, Director Tsubomi!

00:08:10.054 --> 00:08:11.454
Mr. Minamoto, I presume?

00:08:11.454 --> 00:08:13.824
How do you do? I'm Hanae Suetsu!

00:08:14.024 --> 00:08:15.594
Um, hi there.

00:08:15.594 --> 00:08:16.684
Well done!

00:08:16.764 --> 00:08:20.354
All right, could you go on and use
your Hypno power to brainwash him?

00:08:22.334 --> 00:08:23.504
Go to it!

00:08:23.504 --> 00:08:24.264
Sure thing!

00:08:24.264 --> 00:08:25.364
"Sure thing"?!

00:08:26.234 --> 00:08:27.864
Lemme go!

00:08:30.374 --> 00:08:31.844
Stop this!

00:08:37.584 --> 00:08:39.674
No! Stop!

00:08:40.184 --> 00:08:43.454
Let me go! Is this even legal?!

00:08:43.454 --> 00:08:45.754
I kinda doubt it!

00:08:46.954 --> 00:08:49.054
Stop it, please!

00:08:49.254 --> 00:08:50.224
Minamoto.

00:08:57.704 --> 00:09:00.224
Minamoto, just be quiet.

00:09:00.434 --> 00:09:01.694
I'm releasing you.

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:03.634
You... You're!

00:09:04.244 --> 00:09:05.644
It can't be.

00:09:05.704 --> 00:09:09.114
It is. It's me, Minamoto.

00:09:10.084 --> 00:09:13.514
Impossible... Kaoru?!

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:23.184
I just love squid!

00:09:25.624 --> 00:09:28.894
Um, uh... What was that?

00:09:30.704 --> 00:09:32.534
Kaoru...

00:09:32.534 --> 00:09:35.364
Sorry to treat you so harshly.

00:09:42.414 --> 00:09:45.714
Um... What's the big idea, Miss Suetsu?

00:09:52.684 --> 00:09:55.394
What are you doing?!

00:09:55.394 --> 00:09:56.384
D-Director!

00:09:56.764 --> 00:10:00.764
Didn't I tell you he's smart,
suspicious, and hardheaded?!

00:10:00.764 --> 00:10:03.064
So what's the deal with this costume?!

00:10:03.064 --> 00:10:05.534
You're still wearing your name tag!

00:10:05.534 --> 00:10:07.204
I'm sorry, Director!

00:10:07.204 --> 00:10:09.504
But... But, we have other patients here!

00:10:09.504 --> 00:10:10.634
Excuse me...
But... But, we have other patients here!

00:10:10.744 --> 00:10:13.944
If I overuse my ESP here
and then need it later on!

00:10:13.944 --> 00:10:15.674
There's no point to this if you only do it halfway!

00:10:15.944 --> 00:10:17.084
Use the props as well as your powers!

00:10:17.084 --> 00:10:18.114
Hey.
Use the props as well as your powers!

00:10:18.114 --> 00:10:19.484
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:10:19.484 --> 00:10:21.454
What are you trying to do to me here?!

00:10:22.414 --> 00:10:24.924
Oh, well. Explain.

00:10:24.924 --> 00:10:26.084
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:26.084 --> 00:10:29.764
This is a specialized hospice for
the care of terminal patients.

00:10:29.764 --> 00:10:31.454
The care of terminal patients?

00:10:31.524 --> 00:10:35.694
It mainly admits elderly patients
with no hope of recovery,

00:10:35.694 --> 00:10:40.064
a facility that eases their pain and lets
them meet their end with happiness.

00:10:40.534 --> 00:10:44.774
I help them by using my Hypno power.

00:10:44.774 --> 00:10:47.864
My, doesn't it seem like the
closest thing to heaven?

00:10:48.144 --> 00:10:51.014
Old lovers and family who
are no longer with us...

00:10:51.014 --> 00:10:54.884
I care for my patient's hearts by
turning myself into those people.

00:10:55.314 --> 00:10:57.954
You use your ESP to help others?

00:10:57.954 --> 00:10:59.924
That's a wonderful job, isn't it?

00:11:00.454 --> 00:11:04.124
This is what it is to use your
talents in the service of others.

00:11:04.124 --> 00:11:07.224
So then why did you use them
for this villainous woman?!

00:11:07.664 --> 00:11:09.394
She ordered me to!

00:11:09.394 --> 00:11:12.004
She said if I did it, she'd increase
the hospital's budget!

00:11:12.004 --> 00:11:13.934
You don't have to give him all the details!

00:11:14.074 --> 00:11:16.734
Like i said, you're too inflexible!

00:11:17.544 --> 00:11:19.564
The Children aren't just regular children.

00:11:19.944 --> 00:11:22.174
They are potential angels or demons.

00:11:22.174 --> 00:11:25.514
How they grow up... depends on you!

00:11:26.044 --> 00:11:28.614
You must stop thinking of them
as the kids they are now

00:11:28.614 --> 00:11:31.814
and keep that always in mind!
This is the objective of this training!

00:11:32.124 --> 00:11:36.454
And that will let me change the future?
Is there any basis for that?

00:11:36.864 --> 00:11:38.294
Women's intuition.

00:11:40.634 --> 00:11:43.124
Well then, I'll be leaving, now.

00:11:43.504 --> 00:11:46.494
Cut it out and do as I say!

00:11:46.974 --> 00:11:49.374
If you can forge bonds out of a deep love,

00:11:49.374 --> 00:11:52.244
you can change destiny in a snap!

00:11:52.244 --> 00:11:57.644
Fujiko won't let you go back till the image
of them as adults never leaves your brain!

00:11:57.644 --> 00:11:59.234
You're crazy!

00:11:59.714 --> 00:12:02.814
Okay, next will be little Shiho. Put this on.

00:12:02.814 --> 00:12:04.024
And this.

00:12:04.024 --> 00:12:04.714
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:05.084 --> 00:12:09.494
You are now Shiho Sannomiya.
Bury yourself in the role!

00:12:09.764 --> 00:12:12.594
I am a Level 7 esper.

00:12:12.594 --> 00:12:14.864
I've loved Mr. Minamoto
since I was 10 years old!

00:12:14.994 --> 00:12:15.294
"The Glass Minamoto"
Fujiko Tsubomi Theater, vol. 29

00:12:15.294 --> 00:12:16.864
"The Glass Minamoto"
Fujiko Tsubomi Theater, vol. 29
I am now 20 years old. And now... Now!

00:12:16.864 --> 00:12:18.454
I am now 20 years old. And now... Now!

00:12:21.574 --> 00:12:25.564
Mr. Minamoto, since you're on this
island anyway, please take me out.

00:12:25.904 --> 00:12:27.804
S-Sure, but...

00:12:28.614 --> 00:12:31.744
I've gotta get this done and get back home!

00:12:33.184 --> 00:12:35.954
This time, she's really committed
herself to wearing the mask.

00:12:35.954 --> 00:12:38.144
Hanae, you're a frightening girl.

00:13:02.674 --> 00:13:03.804
Say something!

00:13:04.484 --> 00:13:08.574
Um... It must be hard, working in a hospital.

00:13:09.684 --> 00:13:12.154
I said she's Shiho, remember?!

00:13:13.694 --> 00:13:16.594
Would you say that to Shiho?!

00:13:16.594 --> 00:13:19.364
Come on... Even if you say that!

00:13:19.364 --> 00:13:22.294
What kind of idiot brings a girl here
and then talks about work?!

00:13:22.294 --> 00:13:23.094
So, what should I do?!

00:13:23.094 --> 00:13:26.774
Think for yourself! Don't you have stuff
you want to say but not to children?!

00:13:26.774 --> 00:13:27.874
No, I don't!

00:13:27.874 --> 00:13:29.164
Um...

00:13:29.334 --> 00:13:30.034
WHAT?!

00:13:30.474 --> 00:13:33.004
Since nobody would do well being
thrown into this sort of thing,

00:13:33.004 --> 00:13:35.774
why don't you just leave this
to me and back off a little?

00:13:36.114 --> 00:13:38.884
Shiho's mask has slipped!

00:13:38.884 --> 00:13:41.714
I think we've beaten that joke to death. Let's go.

00:13:41.814 --> 00:13:42.714
S-Sure.

00:13:46.824 --> 00:13:51.284
S-Sorry. Looks like I got a little
too deeply into character.

00:13:53.834 --> 00:13:56.434
I can hold your hand, can't I?

00:13:56.434 --> 00:13:57.404
Shiho...

00:13:57.404 --> 00:14:00.964
Not bad! He's practically ready
to put the glass slipper on her!

00:14:01.104 --> 00:14:03.804
CROCODILE BANANA GARDEN

00:14:06.344 --> 00:14:06.444
Got the croc!

00:14:06.444 --> 00:14:08.214
Do not fish for Crocodiles!
Got the croc!

00:14:08.214 --> 00:14:11.444
Do not fish for Crocodiles!
This banana ice tastes good
with crocodile meat in it.

00:14:11.444 --> 00:14:14.884
Do not fish for Crocodiles!
What are you doing?
Quit making side trips and go!

00:14:14.884 --> 00:14:18.054
Do not fish for Crocodiles!
The place the chief told us about is nearby!

00:14:18.054 --> 00:14:20.254
Do not fish for Crocodiles!
What'd you buy, Aoi?

00:14:20.254 --> 00:14:22.094
Do not fish for Crocodiles!
Choco-banana, crocodile flavor!

00:14:22.494 --> 00:14:25.164
I know I'm under orders to appear in this form,

00:14:25.164 --> 00:14:27.434
but you don't have to be so concerned about it.

00:14:27.434 --> 00:14:28.524
S-Sure.

00:14:29.234 --> 00:14:33.604
You seem to have a resistance to ESP.

00:14:33.604 --> 00:14:37.474
You're not like the elderly here, so it's
not as easy for me to pull it off.

00:14:38.974 --> 00:14:40.944
I'm getting a strange sort of feeling.

00:14:41.274 --> 00:14:44.684
Your work must keep you busy,
and now you have to do this, too.

00:14:44.684 --> 00:14:46.414
Tough day for both of us, huh?

00:14:46.414 --> 00:14:49.644
Oh, no. This is a nice change of pace.

00:14:50.484 --> 00:14:54.894
I get to use my power as I like for this job.

00:14:56.294 --> 00:14:59.764
Although having to watch people
pass away all the time...

00:14:59.764 --> 00:15:01.624
I guess it is hard, sometimes.

00:15:03.434 --> 00:15:06.364
Do you enjoy your work, Mr. Minamoto?

00:15:07.434 --> 00:15:10.074
It has its ups and downs, but...

00:15:10.074 --> 00:15:12.404
There's no way I can just walk away from it.

00:15:14.974 --> 00:15:19.184
The day will come when I really will
spend your time with them like this.

00:15:19.184 --> 00:15:22.174
Those girls will be lovely when
they grown up, I'm sure.

00:15:22.254 --> 00:15:23.754
I look forward to it.

00:15:23.754 --> 00:15:25.854
I'm so happy!

00:15:25.854 --> 00:15:29.324
Stop trying to write my inner monologue!

00:15:29.324 --> 00:15:31.484
Well, quit being so stubborn!

00:15:33.264 --> 00:15:34.324
Yes?

00:15:35.294 --> 00:15:38.094
Right. Right, I'll get back there at once.

00:15:38.964 --> 00:15:40.204
What's wrong?

00:15:40.204 --> 00:15:42.694
A patient's condition just
took a turn for the worse.

00:15:42.804 --> 00:15:45.004
I have to go.

00:15:45.074 --> 00:15:45.844
Wait!

00:15:45.844 --> 00:15:47.414
Director, teleport her!

00:15:47.414 --> 00:15:48.634
Sure, sure!

00:15:51.014 --> 00:15:52.914
Who was that just now?

00:15:52.914 --> 00:15:56.584
You sensed a malicious, indecent woman, right?

00:15:56.584 --> 00:15:58.484
Someone as bad as you, Shiho?

00:15:59.354 --> 00:16:03.524
What kind of training is it?!
Oh, this is pissing me off!

00:16:03.894 --> 00:16:05.824
MI-NA-MO-TO!

00:16:07.464 --> 00:16:10.164
I'm going to die...

00:16:10.164 --> 00:16:13.804
Don't say such things! Don't leave me alone!

00:16:13.804 --> 00:16:15.964
Hanako...

00:16:16.304 --> 00:16:17.934
Hana!

00:16:20.514 --> 00:16:23.574
Taro! Taro!

00:16:23.744 --> 00:16:25.684
Man! Thought I was a goner there!

00:16:26.044 --> 00:16:29.484
Taro, it's too soon for you to go to heaven.

00:16:29.484 --> 00:16:32.854
Just hang on a little longer. I'm here with you!

00:16:33.284 --> 00:16:35.914
Thank you, Hanako...

00:16:37.894 --> 00:16:39.294
Nice job.

00:16:44.934 --> 00:16:46.634
This time it's Aoi.

00:16:46.634 --> 00:16:51.264
Does she need to maintain her
transformation even outside of work?

00:16:51.604 --> 00:16:53.304
Naturally.

00:16:55.274 --> 00:16:57.114
You really are amazing.

00:16:57.114 --> 00:16:59.844
You kept that patient going, didn't you?

00:16:59.844 --> 00:17:03.944
That old man lost his first love in the war.

00:17:04.584 --> 00:17:08.424
So, when he takes a bad turn,
I take that form to encourage him.

00:17:09.254 --> 00:17:12.424
I've heard all about the people
he treasures in his memories.

00:17:12.424 --> 00:17:15.484
Even if he knows I'm not real, he still does it.

00:17:16.164 --> 00:17:18.434
See? Isn't the power of love amazing?

00:17:18.434 --> 00:17:20.104
Fine! You mind backing off a little?!

00:17:20.104 --> 00:17:21.224
But...

00:17:28.674 --> 00:17:33.584
Even though I can comfort the patients,
I can't cure them!

00:17:34.484 --> 00:17:38.314
Sometimes I wonder why I was born an esper!

00:17:39.124 --> 00:17:42.684
That old man is so much younger
than you, Director, but!

00:17:42.754 --> 00:17:45.664
I told you! I don't like my age being discussed!

00:17:45.664 --> 00:17:46.724
Easy! Easy!

00:17:46.724 --> 00:17:49.064
And he's a much better person than you, too!

00:17:49.064 --> 00:17:49.734
Now, look!

00:17:49.734 --> 00:17:50.934
Easy, easy, easy!

00:17:50.934 --> 00:17:54.634
You think having pleasant memories
makes you happy when you die?!

00:17:54.634 --> 00:17:57.904
Fujiko doesn't have nearly
enough memories for that!

00:17:57.904 --> 00:18:01.504
You're just some pervert with
a bottomless pit of desires.

00:18:01.874 --> 00:18:03.474
Mr. Minamoto!

00:18:06.644 --> 00:18:09.674
A-Aoi... I mean!

00:18:14.054 --> 00:18:16.614
MI-NA-MO-TO!

00:18:17.324 --> 00:18:18.984
Darn it! Just when it was getting good!

00:18:19.324 --> 00:18:20.994
Now it's a different woman.

00:18:20.994 --> 00:18:22.794
What's the meaning of this?

00:18:23.734 --> 00:18:25.464
Um, uh... That is!

00:18:26.104 --> 00:18:27.164
A crocodile?!

00:18:27.234 --> 00:18:30.434
You actually like this unsexy,
flat-chested girl with glasses?!

00:18:30.504 --> 00:18:32.244
Mr. Minamoto, you pervert!

00:18:32.244 --> 00:18:34.104
That's how she looks to you?

00:18:34.314 --> 00:18:36.274
You really are the enemy, Grandma!

00:18:42.214 --> 00:18:43.984
Oh, hello, Fujiko.

00:18:43.984 --> 00:18:46.654
How'd you like my performance before?

00:18:46.654 --> 00:18:49.814
Nobody nails a death scene like I can!

00:18:51.764 --> 00:18:53.884
My... My mask has slipped as well!

00:18:54.034 --> 00:18:56.654
RUMBLE-RUMBLE-RUMBLE

00:18:56.904 --> 00:18:58.764
No! You've got it all wrong!

00:18:58.764 --> 00:19:00.704
It really always happens like that!

00:19:00.704 --> 00:19:03.134
The director insisted that we do it like this today!

00:19:03.134 --> 00:19:05.004
Quit it, you little traitor!

00:19:12.884 --> 00:19:15.744
What color is your blood?!

00:19:16.084 --> 00:19:17.384
We're sorry...

00:19:23.594 --> 00:19:25.424
What just happened?

00:19:29.994 --> 00:19:32.164
You really mean it? We can play?

00:19:32.504 --> 00:19:34.904
Sure. We'll head back at nightfall.

00:19:35.004 --> 00:19:35.994
All right!

00:19:37.274 --> 00:19:39.034
One thing, though...

00:19:39.904 --> 00:19:41.644
Um... Look...

00:19:41.644 --> 00:19:44.134
I'm sorry I threatened to quit.

00:19:44.544 --> 00:19:45.774
Minamoto.

00:19:45.944 --> 00:19:48.204
Mr. Minamoto.

00:19:52.854 --> 00:19:55.924
I won't say it again. So, let's just say we're even.

00:19:55.924 --> 00:19:58.084
Sure! Thank goodness!

00:19:58.224 --> 00:20:00.254
All right, let's have some fun!

00:20:00.334 --> 00:20:02.364
The Children, released with swimsuits!

00:20:02.364 --> 00:20:02.934
<<RELEASED>>
The Children, released with swimsuits!

00:20:05.464 --> 00:20:07.734
Super fine ladies, dripping with sea water!

00:20:08.104 --> 00:20:10.694
Beautiful white skin, shining in the sun!

00:20:11.074 --> 00:20:13.474
Beach fairies lovelier than any mermaid!

00:20:13.874 --> 00:20:16.364
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:20:24.284 --> 00:20:28.154
Look, Fujiko didn't mean any harm in doing this.

00:20:28.154 --> 00:20:31.524
She did it for the sake of
humanity's future. Really!

00:20:31.724 --> 00:20:32.994
Enough.

00:20:32.994 --> 00:20:37.604
As far as I see it, a little age
difference isn't such a big problem.

00:20:37.604 --> 00:20:40.504
After all, I'm 10 years younger than Fujiko.

00:20:40.504 --> 00:20:42.594
Your age itself is the problem!

00:20:43.104 --> 00:20:46.604
Their one and only childhood
is happening right now.

00:20:46.604 --> 00:20:49.044
And there's a future which may
be saved with these memories.

00:20:49.044 --> 00:20:51.474
You brought me here to see that, didn't you?

00:20:52.784 --> 00:20:56.684
Their "now" is just as important
as humanity's future.

00:20:56.754 --> 00:20:58.584
I know that.

00:20:58.584 --> 00:21:03.024
Because of the way you are,
then can spread their wings in peace.

00:21:03.024 --> 00:21:05.694
I just hope you can hurry up with that.

00:21:05.694 --> 00:21:06.524
With what?

00:21:06.594 --> 00:21:07.794
Oh, nothing.

00:21:08.264 --> 00:21:09.894
Mr. Minamoto!

00:21:10.904 --> 00:21:12.954
Let's swim together before you go back!

00:21:13.974 --> 00:21:16.774
What's with that form?!
You don't have to do that now!

00:21:16.774 --> 00:21:20.304
But the director said you'd like this form!

00:21:20.744 --> 00:21:23.614
Still not giving up, huh, Granny?!

00:21:23.614 --> 00:21:25.134
Thank you, thank you!

00:21:25.484 --> 00:21:27.114
Look! Another woman, now!

00:21:27.114 --> 00:21:28.274
What?!

00:21:31.554 --> 00:21:32.744
You!

00:21:34.154 --> 00:21:37.614
STOP THAT!

00:21:38.194 --> 00:21:44.504
Why are you blushing over that
big-breasted, dumb-looking woman?!

00:21:44.504 --> 00:21:47.064
Huh? Is that really how you see her?!

00:21:48.704 --> 00:21:52.864
I'M FLYING!

00:21:54.214 --> 00:21:57.844
I don't get why you keep
looking at other women!

00:21:57.844 --> 00:21:59.984
We're enough for you to look at, aren't we?!

00:21:59.984 --> 00:22:02.414
Mr. Minamoto, you're a weirdo!

00:22:02.584 --> 00:22:04.984
Why would I just want to look
at a bunch of little kids?!

00:22:07.124 --> 00:22:11.154
Treating us like little kids! Like little kids!

00:22:11.224 --> 00:22:13.424
PUNISHMENT!

00:22:14.164 --> 00:22:18.534
Minamoto, you may be able to tame them...
Assuming you survive.

00:22:31.484 --> 00:22:36.214
I embraced your boasting tight

00:22:36.214 --> 00:22:39.154
Even everything about your sad profile

00:22:39.154 --> 00:22:41.524
I love

00:22:41.524 --> 00:22:45.724
Girl who gets stronger with
every wall she breaks

00:22:45.724 --> 00:22:51.594
My eyes will never wander from you

00:22:51.904 --> 00:22:56.904
Because these too-honest feelings in my heart

00:22:56.904 --> 00:23:00.444
Can't be beaten by anyone

00:23:00.444 --> 00:23:03.614
I absolutely will never let you go

00:23:03.614 --> 00:23:05.714
No matter when or why

00:23:05.714 --> 00:23:10.924
And I'll change that still-unseen last scene

00:23:10.924 --> 00:23:15.254
Devils and angels both have wings

00:23:15.254 --> 00:23:20.894
So let's aim for higher skies

00:23:20.894 --> 00:23:25.604
Don't let your smile be clouded anymore

00:23:25.604 --> 00:23:28.204
When the hopes that connect us now

00:23:28.204 --> 00:23:31.974
Rip the darkness apart

00:23:31.974 --> 00:23:34.904
Together, you and I

00:23:35.144 --> 00:23:40.774
Will fly towards the future, Break Your Destiny

00:23:50.694 --> 00:23:50.924
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:50.924 --> 00:23:52.064
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:52.064 --> 00:23:53.224
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:53.224 --> 00:23:54.254
This is the vault?

00:23:54.334 --> 00:23:55.934
It's a mountain of treasure!

00:23:55.934 --> 00:23:58.804
We can buy people hearts
by the gram with all this!

00:23:58.804 --> 00:24:01.134
Quit getting so shamefully excited!

00:24:01.204 --> 00:24:03.334
We came here to guard it!

00:24:03.634 --> 00:24:05.004
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:05.004 --> 00:24:08.614
Episode 30: "Enemies in the Same Boat!
Safecracking is Systematic"

00:24:08.614 --> 00:24:10.574
Nobody would know if we
took two or three coins.

00:24:10.714 --> 00:24:11.884
Gold juggling!

00:24:11.884 --> 00:24:14.454
The owners of this one have been dying,
one after another. So pretty!

00:24:14.454 --> 00:24:15.554
Hey! Hey!

00:24:15.554 --> 00:24:16.754
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:16.754 --> 00:24:17.824
Enemies in the Same Boat!
Safecracking is Systematic
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:17.824 --> 00:24:20.054
Enemies in the Same Boat!
Safecracking is Systematic
